  "contract": [
    "Capture the target address from the live partition base and full sector argument before calling the actual sector-count getter. Keep target fixed thereafter.",
    "Snapshot byte-truncated count once. Initialize16-byte scratch once, read16 bytes from every sector with live partition/device reloads, and retain scratch across partial/failed reads. Ignore read status as stock.",
    "Compute unsigned minimum of header word8; all-FFFFFFFF or empty scan yields marker count1, otherwise minimum+1. Do not infer magic/CRC validation.",
    "Write16-byte marker words CCFFAABB,66889977,count,0, after ring/SDK diagnostics. Reload the write callback after logging; only zero write status returns1."
  ],
